DESCRIPTION:📚🚀🎉Celebrate the newest releases of two of Toronto’
 s Black Canadian authors of youth fiction\, Kamilah Haywood and Angelot Nd
 ongmo! Kamilah has released the #LGBTQ novel FINDING FAMILY\, and Angelot 
 Ndongmo has released BETWEEN CLASSES\, a #performingarts story.  \n\nBoth 
 books are set in the GTA and feature Black protagonists in their senior hi
 gh school years navigating friendships\, dating\, and school while they dr
 eam and work toward their futures.\n \nLorimer Books and A Different Bookl
 ist are proud to present a double launch of both titles on Sept 12\, from 
 1-3pm\, at Blackhurst Cultural Centre. Kamilah and Angelot will read from 
 their respective novels\, and there will be interviews with the authors\, 
 a Q&A with the audience\, and book signings!\n\n Everyone is invited to ce
 lebrate with Kamilah and Angelot their new books! We're hoping to see a lo
 t of young faces in the crowd. These school stories will get you pumped fo
 r the new term - ReadDifferently!📚
LOCATION:Blackhurst Cultural Centre
URL:https://adifferentbooklist.com/events
X-SOURCE:A Different Booklist
